>(Can it be network-booted from a Sun?)

  Your biggest problem, I think, is that the ROM in the VS2000 doesn't
speak tftp or bootp.  It only supports MOP, the Maintenance Operation
Protocol, a DEC proprietary protocol used for net-booting systems,
terminal servers, and the like.  As far as I'm aware, there's no
available implementation of MOP out there for non-DEC OS's.  I don't
know if there's any way around that, but if someone else knows, I'd
_really_ like to know as well.


