Sorry, I can't offer advice on MicroVAX, but we've added
several DEC vxt2000 and NCD xterminals to our MIPS Ultrix
and Alpha OSF machines.  The DEC vxt2000 while having good
monitors had really buggy software.  We've upgrade the
