The sequence to change the title bar is about the only one that is DECterm
specific.  All of the rest of the ESC sequences that the DECterm responds 
to are the same as the corresponding terminal ( VT2xx, VT3xx ) that it 
is emulating.

The escape sequence to change the title bar is 

ESC]21;String-goes-hereESC\

Where ESC is the escape char.



