Try the following:

Make the two file systems on the drive4:

newfs /dev/rrz4a rz23
newfs /dev/rrz4e rz23

mount the new / partition temporarily:

mount /dev/rz4a /mnt

Move to new dir and dump and resore via a pipe:

cd /mnt
dump 0f - / | restore -rf -

Get out of dir and unmount:

cd /
umount /mnt

Now do the same for the other partition.

mount /dev/rz4e /mnt
cd /mnt
dump 0f - /var | restore -rf -
cd /
umount /mnt

Hope this helps.

Cheers simon....


